<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/desmos/usedConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This property relates a literary constraint to the expression creation events in which it was employed as a generative device; subproperty of crm:P33i_was_used_by. The property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is constraint used in"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "è costrizione usata in"@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Questa proprietà collega una costrizione letteraria agli eventi di creazione dell'espressione in cui è stata impiegata come dispositivo generativo; sottoproprietà di crm:P33i_was_used_by. La proprietà ha come domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> .
